OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATown centre car parks could be
OL,4,Aredeveloped for homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FTown centre car parks in Surrey could
OL,7,Fbe used for housing as a council
OL,8,Fexplores options to avoid "concreting
OL,9,Fover green belt".
OL,11,FGloucester Road car park, in Redhill,
OL,12,Fcould be redeveloped to provide 60 new
OL,13,Faffordable and social rent flats.
OL,15,FReigate and Banstead Borough Council is
OL,16,Falso looking for a developer to take on
OL,17,Fa similar project for 40 homes on the
OL,18,FHigh Street car park in Horley,
OL,19,Faccording to the Local Democracy
OL,20,FReporting Service.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
